# Context Discovery

Read `.agents/ai/project-map.json` and `docs/AI_CONTEXT_STRATEGY.md`. Start from
the task type, explicit module/file hints, and changed files. Run the bundled
`scripts/build_context_pack.py` to select paths, reasons, and byte counts within
the approved context budget.

The tool is read-only and does not emit source content. Inspect selected files
progressively; do not load omitted files merely because they are nearby. Expand
only when a configured trigger or inspected evidence requires another bounded
round. `CONTEXT-01` never overrides `GATE-01`, `GATE-02`, compatibility,
security/privacy, or verification requirements.

Report selected modules/routes, files and reasons, budget usage, omissions,
missing paths, documentation gaps, and any requested expansion. Do not modify
files or external state during context discovery.
